[en.FOCUS_C07_LPLAB]
Las Pegasus Lab (LPLAB)

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPLAB_desc]
Las Pegasus Lab is seeking ambitious and highly motivated student unicorns to join our dynamic team! Are you ready to embark on an adventure of scientific discoveries and magical breakthroughs? Look no further, because Las Pegasus Lab has the perfect opportunity for you!\nSome may worry about the not-so-high salary and the long working hours, but we believe that the experience and knowledge you gain from working with us will be invaluable. We are in collaboration with the Equestria Empire Ministry of Magic and Science, and thus a good evaluation from us during your internship will be a great asset for your future career.\nIf you are not a unicorn? No worries! We are also looking for talented pegasi and earth ponies to join our team as well. You are vital part of our experiments! Safety insurance included!

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPLAB_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a special research decision in §YLas Pegasus Lab§!.

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPLAB]
洛马基实验室 (LPLAB)

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPLAB_desc]
洛马基实验室正在寻找有抱负和极具动力的独角兽学生加入我们的团队！你准备好踏上科学发现和魔法突破的冒险了吗？别再犹豫了，因为洛马基实验室为你提供了绝佳的机会！\n有些小马可能会担心薪水不高和工作时间长，但我们相信你在我们这里获得的经验和知识将是无价的。我们与小马利亚帝国魔法和科学部合作，因此我们对你实习期间的良好评价将成为你未来职业生涯的重要资产。\n如果你不是独角兽？别担心！我们也在寻找有才华的天马和陆马加入我们的团队。你们是我们实验的重要组成部分！含安全保险！

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPLAB_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y洛马基实验室§!中的一项专题科研决议。

